pi-persian-rtl-bundle
=====================

This package patches files belonging to Pi
(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), which is distributed under its own
license. No Pi source code is redistributed here; the patch is applied to the
user's own installation at runtime, and a backup of every modified file is
written before any change.

The BiDi helper implementation is derived from pi-persian-rtl by powerostad
(MIT), itself derived from pi-arabic-rtl. See the upstream package at
https://pi.dev/packages/pi-persian-rtl.

Patching another program's bundle is inherently unsupported and may break on
any update. Use at your own risk.
